## h i g h l i g h t s
A proton responsive annunciator based on UIO-66- $\cdot\Nu\mathrm{H}_{2}$ was fabricated. UIO-66- ${\mathsf{N H}}_{2}$ encapsulated methylene blue was functionalized with i-motif DNA. Reformative UIO-66- $\cdot\mathrm{NH}_{2}$ can release methylene blue in an acidic solution.
g r a p h i c a l a b s t r a c t
I-motif DNA structure functionalized UIO-66- $\cdot\Nu\mathrm{H}_{2}$ can responsively release the locked methylene blue to indicate the content of tumor marker when it was placed in an acidic environment. The acidic condition was generated by the aerobic oxidation of glucose that was catalyzed with ZIF-8@GOx immunoprobe.
